<languages />
{{home}}

<div class="wikven-home-lede">
<translate>
<!--T:1-->
{{SITENAME}} is a static site generator that runs on [<tvar name="1">https://www.mediawiki.org/</tvar> MediaWiki], the
software behind [<tvar name="2">https://www.wikipedia.org/</tvar> Wikipedia]. You write wikitext; {{SITENAME}} renders it
through MediaWiki once, at build time, and writes out plain HTML. Nothing runs behind the published
site: no MediaWiki, no PHP, no database.
</translate>
</div>

<div class="wikven-home-demo">
<syntaxhighlight lang="shell" copy>
mkdir src
echo 'Hello, World!' > src/index.wikitext
wikven build
</syntaxhighlight>
<div class="wikven-home-caption">
<translate>
<!--T:2-->
Every <code>.wikitext</code> file under <code>src/</code> comes out as a page under <code>dist/</code>.
This site is one of those builds.
</translate>
</div>
</div>

